### Observation

The answer became more strategic and business-focused.

In short: Prompt 1 answers what. Prompt 2 answers what, why, how, for whom, at what cost, by when, and with what risk — making it boardroom-ready rather than conversation-ready.
The quality of the output is a direct function of the prompt role baeed 

